					<![CDATA[
						 <div class="creditRate"> <div class="creditButtonStandalone"> <p><a class="fa fa-info" href="#u-credit-view"></a></p> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both;"></div> <div id="u-credit-view"> <div class="fader"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/1" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="" style=""></iframe></p> </div> <div class="modalcontainer"> <div class="modalbox"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>著作信息</span></h2> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit first"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/4" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="close-credits" style="height:2em;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> <p><strong>标题：</strong>SOYA-001的SCP相关组织Logo<br /> <strong>绘制：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/soya-001" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2577572&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609356847" alt="SOYA-001" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2577572)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/soya-001" >SOYA-001</a></span><br /> <strong>译者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/backlight-sh" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5374263&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609356847" alt="Backlight SH" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5374263)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/backlight-sh" >Backlight SH</a></span><br /> <strong>校订：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mint-chocolate" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4106733&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609356847" alt="Mint chocolate" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4106733)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mint-chocolate" >Mint chocolate</a></span><br /> <strong>发布年份：</strong>2020年</p> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit-back" style="text-align: center;"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/2" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="height:2em;width: 100%;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>本页登载的是为在SCP基金会（无论哪个分部）登场的一些相关组织（GoI）适当地制作的一些Logo。这些Logo会不定期地以非特定的顺序追加至本页。</p> <p>各相关组织的Logo素材可在<strong><a href="https://1drv.ms/u/s!AnXNtNoGYsm3gcdGdnri6e15Qc8-Xg?e=co1NY7">此处</a></strong>（OneDrive链接）下载。</p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:150%;"><strong>理外学研究所</strong></span></p> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/soya-001-logo-art-01/logo-rigai.jpg" alt="logo-rigai.jpg" class="image" /></div> <p>左侧的是以<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ueh-s" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5372876&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609356847" alt="Ueh-S" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5372876)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ueh-s" >Ueh-S</a></span>制作的<a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/rigaiken-logo">logo</a>为原型而制作的。<br /> 右侧的则参考了现实生活中作为研究机构的理化研究所的Logo。</p> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:150%;"><strong>净土真宗本愿自傲派</strong></span></p> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/soya-001-logo-art-01/logo-hongan.jpg" alt="logo-hongan.jpg" class="image" /></div> <p>净土真宗本愿寺派的宗纹配有下藤纹，这里借用了他们的纹样。<br /> 而莲花则是作为“扎根于我等罪孽深重的凡夫业障之泥的灿烂花朵”的意象出现的。</p> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:150%;"><strong>为了和动漫角色结婚的研究计划局（PAMWAC）</strong></span></p> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/soya-001-logo-art-01/logo-pamwac.jpg" alt="logo-pamwac.jpg" class="image" /></div> <p>左边这个蓝色头发的孩子名为“嫁子”（随便取的）。字体则使用了自制的字体。</p> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:150%;"><strong>如月工务店</strong></span></p> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/soya-001-logo-art-01/logo-kisaragi.jpg" alt="logo-kisaragi.jpg" class="image" /></div> <p>建造异常建筑的鬼之公司。<br /> 如果把徽标顺时针旋转90°就变成了仿佛是笑着的鬼的样子。</p> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:150%;"><strong>Doggy Corp.有限公司</strong></span></p> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/soya-001-logo-art-01/logo-doggy.jpg" alt="logo-doggy.jpg" class="image" /></div> <p>因为是销售犬用商品的公司，所以在Logo上画了一个很大很大的小狗的脸。<br /> 文字也设计得有些老旧的风格。</p> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:150%;"><strong>夏鸟思想联盟</strong></span></p> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/soya-001-logo-art-01/logo-natsudori.jpg" alt="logo-natsudori.jpg" class="image" /></div> <p>高举怀旧主义旗帜的市民团体。<br /> 虽然说在<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/1998-hub">1998设定</a>当中萌生了恐怖主义思想，但是即使是其他的设定也有些过激行为。</p> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:150%;"><strong>AKI商事</strong></span></p> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/soya-001-logo-art-01/logo-aki.jpg" alt="logo-aki.jpg" class="image" /></div> <p>主要销售成人用品的商业公司。<br /> 已经发现其存在多个子公司。</p> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:150%;"><strong>东荣会 / 有村组</strong></span></p> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/soya-001-logo-art-01/logo-arimura.jpg" alt="logo-arimura.jpg" class="image" /></div> <p>被指定为广域指定暴力组织的、处理异常的黑帮组织。</p> <p>东荣会和有村组的代纹当中能够让人感受到二者间的联系。</p> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:150%;"><strong>日本生类创研（2020年）</strong></span></p> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-jp-storage.wdfiles.com/local--files/file%3A2577572-88-vlxx/nisso-logo.png" alt="nisso-logo.png" class="image" /></div> <p>日分的第一个GoI，也是涉及最多（作者认为如此）的，无比熟悉的日创。<br /> 以<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/groups-of-interest-jp">日本国内相关组织</a>页面公开的Logo进行了大幅重设。</p> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:150%;"><strong>东弊重工（2020年）</strong></span></p> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-jp-storage.wdfiles.com/local--files/file%3A2577572-89-de94/touhei-logo.png" alt="touhei-logo.png" class="image" /></div> <p>给人以强烈的日本城镇工厂印象的工业团体，东弊重工。<br /> 沿袭了<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nanimono-demonai" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1703549&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609356847" alt="Nanimono Demonai" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1703549)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nanimono-demonai" >Nanimono Demonai</a></span>在“<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/foundation-or-goi-logo">基金会LOGO</a>”上公开的东弊重工的LOGO，将先进的技术形象展现在面前，以更帅气的外观重新设计。<br /> <strong>2010年11月13日追记：</strong>OneDrive的ZIP文件中附有.svg和.ai文件。</p> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:150%;"><strong>全球超自然联盟（联合国组织版本）</strong></span></p> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-jp-storage.wdfiles.com/local--files/file%3A2577572-90-6eox/GOC-Logo.png" alt="GOC-Logo.png" class="image" /></div> <p>本部的相关组织全球超自然联盟（GOC）的LOGO。<br /> 以意想不到的很少提及的联合国设定为基础，根据<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1888434&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609356847" alt="djkaktus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1888434)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" >djkaktus</a></span>和<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aelanna" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=334454&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609356847" alt="Aelanna" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=334454)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aelanna" >Aelanna</a></span>的原案，以联合国机关的形式进行了重绘。<br /> 橄榄叶部分由<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zhange" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2938475&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609356847" alt="Zhange" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2938475)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zhange" >Zhange</a></span><a href="https://www.instagram.com/p/BjGIX41neBJ/">据此</a>制作。</p> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/backlight-sh" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5374263&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609356847" alt="Backlight SH" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5374263)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/backlight-sh" >Backlight SH</a></span></p> 
				 	]]>
